{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門NOVO LAND發生傷人血案。一名23歲女子遭38歲男友用廚房刀襲擊，前額受傷，警方正追緝涉案男子歸案。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場為屯門欣寶路8號Novo Land。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250407/985935726971457536312974.jpeg/Y2EC3UZCC_6QGC1p6g_qrw_Yz6CYj9-QpVhB849YQfM\"/><figcaption>現場為屯門欣寶路8號Novo Land。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>警方接獲屯門欣寶路8號NOVO LAND第2座保安報案，指23歲姓張女子曾被38歲姓莫男子襲擊。人員接報到場，於現場檢獲一把長約20厘米的廚房刀。張女前額有2厘米刀傷及腳部瘀傷，清醒被送往屯門醫院治理。</p><p>人員經初步調查，相信莫男曾在上址一單位襲擊張女後逃去。案件列作襲擊致造成身體傷害，交由屯門警區刑事調查隊第一隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p><figure><img alt=\"屯門醫院。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177163586779222016496183.jpeg/jpDW-FDNlyg9lxQqdoCA2uGOL1Ln9SFzvAPw0rwD8NI\"/><figcaption>屯門醫院。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.164247+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":262,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:40:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:26:11.376007+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:02.341397+00:00","content_hash":"ce4f5d281aa9c762417bec1239e1d9f032ddc946cce68ce9ec171e790285e741","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}